http://www.freewebs.com/drussell/RevivedHack.htm

Brief history of Hack:

AGB_Hack and RevivedHack are based on Donald Kneller's PC Hack 3.61. PC
Hack was based on Andries E. Brouwer's version--a reworking of Jay
Fenlason's original Rogue-inspired game. Hack evolved into NetHack
around 1987. The two games have some basic elements in common, but the
play strategies of Hack are very different; it should not be considered
an earlier, more primitive version of NetHack.

